WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.346
Step 1. Open the referral page. When you mark a form as entered in error,

1.2
00:00:05.346 --> 00:00:10.803
Care keeps the original answers and shows the form as Entered in Error.

2.1
00:00:10.803 --> 00:00:15.837
Step 2. Find the form in the Request section or the Responses section.

2.2
00:00:15.837 --> 00:00:21.873
Each form shows its title, the time, and the name of the person who filled it in.

3.1
00:00:21.873 --> 00:00:26.964
Step 3. Select the three-dot button at the right of the form's title,

3.2
00:00:26.964 --> 00:00:31.253
then Mark entered in error, the only item of the menu.

4.1
00:00:31.253 --> 00:00:36.233
Step 4. In the dialog, select Mark entered in error to confirm.

4.2
00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:39.761
Care shows Response marked as entered in error,

4.3
00:00:39.761 --> 00:00:43.714
and the form shows the Entered in Error badge.
